    "foundersEn": ["Confucius", "Mencius", "Xunzi"],
    "keyIdeas": ["仁：推己及人的不忍人之心", "礼：维系人伦秩序的外在规范", "中庸：过犹不及的适度智慧", "修身齐家治国平天下"],
    "keyIdeasEn": ["Ren: humane concern extended to others", "Li: ritual that holds human relations together", "Zhongyong: the wisdom of the mean", "Order begins with self-cultivation"],
